The BIOS
========

The BIOS image in this repository (b5501_133x.bin) is a modified copy of
Soekris Engineering's comBIOS 1.33c for the net5501. It contains comBIOS, the
work of Soekris Engineering, Inc., and a PXE boot ROM for the onboard VIA Rhine
Ethernet containing code copyright Intel Corporation. We do not own
any of it, claim no rights in it, and grant no licence to it. The patched image
is provided only so that owners of net5501 boards can keep using their
hardware. The original image was distributed freely from Soekris Engineering's
website and is preserved by the Internet Archive.

